    narr:narration """This position holds that [the tool library runs Saturdays only through winter](narr:Expr_20261009_6_Batch3Rota20261009050853_h8a4eacef57e3_1), grounded in [thin weekday-evening turnout](narr:Expr_20261009_6_Batch3Rota20261009050853_h8a4eacef57e3_2), with [a second volunteer added to the Saturday shift for returns](narr:Expr_20261009_6_Batch3Rota20261009050853_h8a4eacef57e3_3). The arc runs from observed demand to a staffing decision, voiced across two speakers on the same date.""" ;
